                        "review": "This game looks it might be nice but WARNING  --- As of this review (1/14/2018) this game does NOT work with the Oculus touch controllers.  (Several people have indicated they have the same problem in the community hub)\n\nSince that's what I have, I can't play the game, and so I am giving it a \"not recomended\" \n\nI would like to point out that the game SAYS  it works with motion tracked controller,   but aparently not all of them.\n\nHopefully they will get this fixed, and I will be able to change my review.\n\n",
